      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like there’s something fundamentally broken inside me. like i look at people and they seem so... okay. they belong here. but i don't. i remember things i did, or things i didn't do, and it just feels like i'm carrying this weight that makes me a bad person. i don't think i even deserve to be taking up space anymore.",
